      "orig": "A motivated Computer Science Engineering graduate seeking an opportunity to contribute to a dynamic, growth-oriented environment where I can enhance my skills and gain hands-on experience. Passionate about  learning  and  applying  new  technologies,  I  am  excited  to  contribute  to  the  fields  of  software Testing, quality assurance, cloud computing. Organized and dependable, I excel at managing multiple priorities with a positive attitude and am eager to take on additional responsibilities to help achieve team and company goals.",
      "text": "A motivated Computer Science Engineering graduate seeking an opportunity to contribute to a dynamic, growth-oriented environment where I can enhance my skills and gain hands-on experience. Passionate about  learning  and  applying  new  technologies,  I  am  excited  to  contribute  to  the  fields  of  software Testing, quality assurance, cloud computing. Organized and dependable, I excel at managing multiple priorities with a positive attitude and am eager to take on additional responsibilities to help achieve team and company goals."
